{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02950","headline":"正月晦日侍宴滻水应制赋得长字 · 宗楚客","name":"正月晦日侍宴滻水应制赋得长字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"御辇出明光，乘流泛羽觞。\n珠胎随月减，玉漏与年长。\n寒尽梅犹白，风迟柳未黄。\n日斜旌骑转，休气满林塘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宗楚客","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02950.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02950","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}